"下载尚未确认停止，正在等待写入结束；结束后才可重试或删除文件。" = "The download has not confirmed that it stopped and is still finishing its writes; retry or delete the file once it ends.";

"下载仍在停止中" = "Download Is Still Stopping";

"旧执行尚未结束，不能同时启动新的写入。请等待停止完成后重试。" = "The previous run has not finished, so a new write cannot start yet. Wait for it to stop, then try again.";

"无音轨" = "No Audio Track";

"产物只有视频轨、没有音频：来源清单本身只含视频流。可回到页面改选带音频的清单重新下载。" = "The result has video but no audio because the source manifest only contains a video stream. Go back to the page and choose a manifest with audio to download again.";

"用户取消了接管，并要求同时取消浏览器下载。" = "The user cancelled the takeover and asked to cancel the browser download as well.";

"与浏览器地址栏中的主机一致；www.example.com 与 example.com 是两个不同的站点。" = "Must match the host in the browser's address bar; www.example.com and example.com are different sites.";

"该站点已保存过 Cookie（更新于 %@）；粘贴新值并保存即会覆盖。" = "A cookie is already saved for this site (updated %@); pasting and saving a new value replaces it.";

"站点主机名（如 example.com）" = "Site host name (for example, example.com)";

"站点会话仅用于 https 下载。" = "Site sessions are used only for https downloads.";

"域名无法作为站点会话保存，请填写完整主机名（例如 example.com）。" = "This domain cannot be saved as a site session; enter a full host name (for example, example.com).";

"无法保存到钥匙串：%@" = "Could not save to the Keychain: %@";

"如何获取：登录 → F12 → Network → ⌘R 刷新 → 点列表第一行 → 复制 Cookie 值" = "How to get it: sign in → F12 → Network → ⌘R to reload → click the first row → copy the Cookie value";

"第 1 步 · 先登录，再刷新" = "Step 1 · Sign in, then reload";

"在浏览器中正常登录该站点，按 F12（或右键页面选“检查”）打开开发者工具并切到 Network（网络）面板，然后按 ⌘R 刷新一次页面。必须登录之后再刷新，否则发出的请求里没有登录 Cookie。" = "Sign in to the site in your browser as usual, press F12 (or right-click the page and choose Inspect) to open the developer tools, switch to the Network panel, then press ⌘R to reload the page once. Reload after signing in, otherwise the requests carry no sign-in cookie.";

"第 2 步 · 点击“页面主请求”" = "Step 2 · Click the page's main request";

"刷新后请求列表的第一行通常就是当前页面本身：Name（名称）与地址栏网址一致，Type（类型）列显示 document。它带 Cookie 的概率最高。列表太杂时，点类型栏里的 Doc（文档）按钮只看文档类请求，选最上面一行。" = "After reloading, the first row of the request list is usually the page itself: its Name matches the address bar and its Type column shows document. It is the request most likely to carry the cookie. If the list is crowded, click Doc in the type bar to show only document requests and pick the top row.";

"第 3 步 · 复制 Cookie 值" = "Step 3 · Copy the Cookie value";

"点开该请求，在右侧 Headers（标头）面板向下滚动到 Request Headers（请求标头）小节，找到 Cookie 一行，复制冒号后面的全部内容。开头的 “Cookie:” 三个字母不用管，保存时会自动去掉。同一站点不同请求带的 Cookie 可能略有差异（个别字段随请求变化），任选一份都可以，关键是包含登录字段（例如 B 站的 SESSDATA）。" = "Open the request, scroll down the Headers panel to Request Headers, find the Cookie line, and copy everything after the colon. Ignore a leading “Cookie:”; it is removed when you save. Different requests on the same site may carry slightly different cookies (some fields change per request); any one works as long as it includes the sign-in fields (for example, Bilibili's SESSDATA).";

"第 4 步 · 第一行没有 Cookie 怎么办" = "Step 4 · The first row has no cookie";

"js、css、图片、字体等静态文件请求基本都不带 Cookie，不必逐个去点。把类型栏换成 Fetch/XHR，点击一个名称像接口的请求（常含 api、user、login、info 等字样，且域名与本站相同），在它的 Request Headers 里找 Cookie。" = "Static files such as js, css, images and fonts rarely carry cookies, so there is no need to check them one by one. Switch the type bar to Fetch/XHR, click a request that looks like an API call (names often contain api, user, login or info, on the same domain as the site), and look for Cookie in its Request Headers.";

"第 5 步 · 还是找不到" = "Step 5 · Still can't find it";

"多半是刷新发生在登录之前：重新登录后再刷新一次。若依旧没有，该站点可能不需要 Cookie 或登录状态在别的域名下，改用 Chrome 插件提交下载即可自动携带登录状态，无需手动粘贴。" = "Most likely the page was reloaded before you signed in: sign in again and reload once more. If there is still nothing, the site may not need a cookie or keeps its sign-in on another domain; submit the download from the Chrome extension instead, which carries the sign-in automatically, with no pasting needed.";

"作用范围" = "Scope";

"Cookie 按站点隔离，仅用于该主机的 https 下载（不用于 http 或兄弟子域；由于未实现 Path 属性解析，在同一主机的不同路径下均会复用）。保存后对该站点的解析与下载自动生效。" = "Cookies are isolated per site and used only for https downloads from that host (not for http or sibling subdomains; because the Path attribute is not parsed, they are reused across all paths on the same host). Once saved, they apply automatically to inspection and downloads for that site.";

"yt-dlp 无法启动" = "yt-dlp Cannot Start";

